    {
      "body": "EVIDENCE. The annual paid-monthly plan selector emphasizes monthly downloads and monthly price, while the complaint alleges material annual-renewal and cancellation-fee terms were not clearly and conspicuously disclosed.\nLEGAL REASONING. The legal issue is that the plan is presented as a monthly-priced choice even though annual commitment, renewal, and cancellation-fee terms materially affect the purchase decision.\nSTATED LAW. FTC Act Section 5(a), 15 U.S.C. 45(a); ROSCA Section 4(1), 15 U.S.C. 8403(1).",
