      "body": "EVIDENCE. The cancellation page reveals the early cancellation fee and offers no way to dispute it within the self-cancellation flow.\nLEGAL REASONING. The complaint alleges many consumers learned the cancellation fee only on the seventh page of the cancellation flow, forcing them to abandon cancellation, continue paying, or contact customer service.\nSTATED LAW. FTC Act Section 5(a), 15 U.S.C. 45(a); ROSCA Section 4(3), 15 U.S.C. 8403(3).",
