    {
      "body": "EVIDENCE. The plan page sets the annual paid-monthly plan as the default and presents the cancellation-fee disclosure only as a weak line of text and terms hyperlink.\nLEGAL REASONING. The complaint alleges the default plan and bright purchase button outweighed the small disclosure, leaving automatic renewal and cancellation-fee terms insufficiently clear.\nSTATED LAW. FTC Act Section 5(a), 15 U.S.C. 45(a); ROSCA Section 4(1), 15 U.S.C. 8403(1).",
