    {
      "body": "EVIDENCE. The marketing email promotes packs as best for a one-time project with no commitment, while the complaint alleges these packs automatically renewed after one year before February 2024.\nLEGAL REASONING. The one-time/no-commitment framing contradicts the alleged automatic renewal term, making the omitted renewal information material to the consumer's decision.\nSTATED LAW. FTC Act Section 5(a), 15 U.S.C. 45(a); ROSCA Section 4(1), 15 U.S.C. 8403(1).",
