    {
      "body": "EVIDENCE. The final pack checkout collects payment information and completes purchase while automatic refill, expiration, additional charge amount, and avoidance terms are not disclosed before billing information is obtained.\nLEGAL REASONING. The complaint alleges that pack refill and expiration terms were material negative-option terms and were not clearly presented before the consumer entered the transaction.\nSTATED LAW. FTC Act Section 5(a), 15 U.S.C. 45(a); ROSCA Section 4(1)-(2), 15 U.S.C. 8403(1)-(2).",
