    {
      "body": "EVIDENCE. The free-trial offer invites consumers to get free images, while the complaint alleges the trial converted into an automatically renewing annual plan with a cancellation fee.\nLEGAL REASONING. The free-trial framing is legally material because the consumer is not clearly told before enrollment that the trial converts to an annual recurring plan with a fee to cancel early.\nSTATED LAW. FTC Act Section 5(a), 15 U.S.C. 45(a); ROSCA Section 4(1), 15 U.S.C. 8403(1).",
